---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<style type="text/css">
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    svg {
      filter: invert(93%) hue-rotate(180deg);
      background-color: transparent !important;
    }
    image {
      filter: invert(100%) hue-rotate(180deg) saturate(1.25);
    }
  }
</style>

<Layout title="Homelab - Antoine JOSSET">
  <Header showTitle={false} />

  <section
    class="px-6 mb-8 flex flex-col gap-3"
    aria-labelledby="homelab-title"
  >
    <h1
      id="homelab-title"
      class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-7 tracking-tight"
    >
      Homelab
    </h1>
    <p class="max-w-xl text-muted leading-7">
      Mon infrastructure self-hostee pour mes services perso et mes
      experimentations.
    </p>
    <p class="max-w-xl text-muted leading-7">
      Ce homelab me sert de bac a sable pour tester des architectures reseau,
      heberger mes applications et surveiller l'etat de mes services en continu.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section
    class="relative left-1/2 mb-10 flex w-screen max-w-4xl -translate-x-1/2 flex-col gap-4 px-4 sm:px-6"
  >
    <button
      type="button"
      class="group relative w-full focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background"
    >
      <img
        src="/homelab-architecture-light.svg"
        class="h-auto w-full object-contain"
      />
    </button>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 mb-10 flex flex-col gap-6 text-muted leading-7">
    <h2 id="homelab-details" class="sr-only">Details du homelab</h2>

    <p class="max-w-xl">
      J'y centralise les acces via reverse proxy, l'authentification SSO,
      l'observabilite et des applications internes (stats Spotify, PDF,
      dashboard NAS, etc.).
    </p>

    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="mb-2 text-primary font-medium">Briques principales</p>
      <ul class="space-y-1">
        <li>Reverse proxy avec Nginx Proxy Manager et DNS Cloudflare</li>
        <li>SSO avec Authelia pour securiser les applications exposees</li>
        <li>Monitoring centralise via Grafana, Loki et Prometheus</li>
        <li>Services self-hostes: Harmony, Vaultwarden, outils NAS</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="max-w-xl">
      L'objectif est d'avoir une plateforme fiable, observable et simple a faire
      evoluer.
    </p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
